OL,3,GNEWSAArrests at building site over
OL,4,Adiesel siphoning
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof siphoning hundreds of litres of
OL,8,Fdiesel in Selby.
OL,10,FNorth Yorkshire Police were called to a
OL,11,Fbuilding contractor's site at 22:15 BST
OL,12,Fon Saturday where the men were
OL,13,Freportedly stealing the fuel from a
OL,14,Fgenerator.
OL,16,FThe force said when officers arrived
OL,17,Fthe pair were sat in a van next to the
OL,18,Fgenerator and had siphoned nearly 350
OL,19,Flitres of diesel.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
