OL,3,GNEWSAArrests at building site over
OL,4,Adiesel siphoning
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe men, aged 49 and 51, both from West
OL,7,FYorkshire, were arrested on suspicion
OL,8,Fof theft of fuel and burglary and
OL,9,Freleased on bail.
